 1                            II.   THIRD BENCH REQUEST
 2   Q.   What is the purpose of this supplemental testimony?

 3   A.   The purpose of my supplemental testimony is to respond to the following Third

 4        Bench Request issued by the New Mexico Public Regulation Commission

 5        (“Commission”):

 6               “SPS shall provide updated and executable versions of the following Rule
 7               530 Schedules:”

 8               •   “Schedule A-1: Summary of Total Capitalization and the Weighted
 9                   Average Cost of Capital”

10               •   “Schedule A-3: Summary of the Cost of Service Adjustments by
11                   Functional Classification”

12               •   “Schedule A-4: Summary of Rate Base”
13   Q.   Are you providing any updated attachments as part of your testimony?

14   A.   Yes. In response to the Third Bench Request from the Commission, I am providing

15        an updated versions of Schedules A-1, A-3, and A-4 that reflect stipulation-specific

16        information.

17   Q.   Does this conclude your pre-filed supplemental testimony?

18   A.   Yes.




